{"id":"fin","lat":"fin","ar":"فين","en":"where","note":"fin kayn...? is where is...? Combine with prepositions: mnin is from where, l-fin is to where.","s":[{"lat":"{fin} kayn l-bank?","ar":"{فين} كاين البنك؟","en":"Where is the bank?"},{"lat":"{fin} ghadi tmchi daba?","ar":"{فين} غادي تمشي دابا؟","en":"Where are you going now?"},{"lat":"{fin} katskun?","ar":"{فين} كتسكن؟","en":"Where do you live?"},{"lat":"{fin} l-mhatta?","ar":"{فين} المحطة؟","en":"Where is the station?"},{"lat":"{fin} t3ellemti d-darija?","ar":"{فين} تعلمتي الدارجة؟","en":"Where did you learn Darija?"},{"lat":"{fin} l-mdrasa dyalk?","ar":"{فين} المدرسة ديالك؟","en":"Where is your school?"},{"lat":"{fin} kaynin l-mfatih?","ar":"{فين} كاينين المفاتيح؟","en":"Where are the keys?"},{"lat":"{fin} kayn s-sbitar?","ar":"{فين} كاين السبيطار؟","en":"Where is the hospital?"},{"lat":"{fin} n9der nlqa taksi?","ar":"{فين} نقدر نلقى طاكسي؟","en":"Where can I find a taxi?"},{"lat":"{fin} mchat Fatima?","ar":"{فين} مشات فاطمة؟","en":"Where did Fatima go?"}]},
{"id":"m3ach","lat":"m3ach","ar":"معاش","en":"with what","note":"m3a plus ach: with what. For a person say m3a chkun (with whom). For a tool or means, bach (with what, by what) is just as common.","s":[{"lat":"{m3ach} katakul l-khubz?","ar":"{معاش} كتاكل الخبز؟","en":"What do you eat the bread with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} kat7ibb l-atay?","ar":"{معاش} كتحب الأتاي؟","en":"What do you like your tea with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} ghadi tfetter ghedda?","ar":"{معاش} غادي تفطر غدا؟","en":"What will you have breakfast with tomorrow?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} katchrub d-dwa?","ar":"{معاش} كتشرب الدوا؟","en":"What do you take the medicine with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} katwejjed s-salata?","ar":"{معاش} كتوجد السلاطة؟","en":"What do you prepare the salad with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} kayakul l-kuskus?","ar":"{معاش} كياكل الكسكس؟","en":"What does he eat couscous with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} ghadi nakulu l-7rira?","ar":"{معاش} غادي نكلو الحريرة؟","en":"What will we eat the harira with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} kayakulu s-sardin?","ar":"{معاش} كياكلو السردين؟","en":"What do they eat sardines with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} kat7ibb l-bid dyalk?","ar":"{معاش} كتحب البيض ديالك؟","en":"What do you like your eggs with?"},{"lat":"{m3ach} tchrebti d-dwa l-bare7?","ar":"{معاش} شربتي الدوا البارح؟","en":"What did you take the medicine with yesterday?"}]},
{"id":"wa9tach","lat":"wa9tach","ar":"وقتاش","en":"when","note":"Same meaning as imta. wa9tach is a little more careful, imta is the everyday short form.","like":"imta","s":[{"lat":"{wa9tach} ghadi tji?","ar":"{وقتاش} غادي تجي؟","en":"When are you coming?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} kaybda l-film?","ar":"{وقتاش} كيبدا الفيلم؟","en":"When does the film start?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} wsel bak?","ar":"{وقتاش} وصل باك؟","en":"When did your father arrive?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} kaywsel l-qtar?","ar":"{وقتاش} كيوصل القطار؟","en":"When does the train arrive?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} ghadi nt9abelu?","ar":"{وقتاش} غادي نتقابلو؟","en":"When are we going to meet?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} katsali l-khdma?","ar":"{وقتاش} كتسالي الخدمة؟","en":"When do you finish work?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} 3ndk l-imti7an?","ar":"{وقتاش} عندك الامتحان؟","en":"When is your exam?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} kay7ell s-suq?","ar":"{وقتاش} كيحل السوق؟","en":"When does the market open?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} ghadi nakulu?","ar":"{وقتاش} غادي نكلو؟","en":"When are we going to eat?"},{"lat":"{wa9tach} rje3ti mn s-sfer?","ar":"{وقتاش} رجعتي من السفر؟","en":"When did you come back from the trip?"}]},
{"id":"imta","lat":"imta","ar":"إمتا","en":"when","note":"Same meaning as wa9tach. imta is the short everyday form.","like":"wa9tach","s":[{"lat":"{imta} ghadi nchufuk?","ar":"{إمتا} غادي نشوفوك؟","en":"When will we see you?"},{"lat":"{imta} kaybda l-film?","ar":"{إمتا} كيبدا الفيلم؟","en":"When does the film start?"},{"lat":"{imta} jat khtek?","ar":"{إمتا} جات ختك؟","en":"When did your sister come?"},{"lat":"{imta} ghadi tsali l-9raya?","ar":"{إمتا} غادي تسالي القراية؟","en":"When will you finish your studies?"},{"lat":"{imta} kay7ell l-bank?","ar":"{إمتا} كيحل البنك؟","en":"When does the bank open?"},{"lat":"{imta} kaymchi l-qtar?","ar":"{إمتا} كيمشي القطار؟","en":"When does the train leave?"},{"lat":"{imta} 3id miladek?","ar":"{إمتا} عيد ميلادك؟","en":"When is your birthday?"},{"lat":"{imta} ghadi twelli d-dar?","ar":"{إمتا} غادي تولي للدار؟","en":"When will you get back home?"},{"lat":"{imta} kayji l-bustaji?","ar":"{إمتا} كيجي البوسطجي؟","en":"When does the postman come?"},{"lat":"{imta} ghadi n7ellu l-7anut?","ar":"{إمتا} غادي نحلو الحانوت؟","en":"When are we going to open the shop?"}]},
{"id":"kifach","lat":"kifach","ar":"كيفاش","en":"how","note":"Also kif. For how are you, kifach nta? and labas? are both fine; labas is more common.","s":[{"lat":"{kifach} nwesl l s-suq?","ar":"{كيفاش} نوصل للسوق؟","en":"How do I get to the market?"},{"lat":"{kifach} kaykhdem had t-tilifun?","ar":"{كيفاش} كيخدم هاد التيليفون؟","en":"How does this phone work?"},{"lat":"{kifach} katqul had l-klma b-darija?","ar":"{كيفاش} كتقول هاد الكلمة بالدارجة؟","en":"How do you say this word in Darija?"},{"lat":"{kifach} daz l-3id?","ar":"{كيفاش} داز العيد؟","en":"How was the Eid?"},{"lat":"{kifach} katwejjed l-atay?","ar":"{كيفاش} كتوجد الأتاي؟","en":"How do you make the tea?"},{"lat":"{kifach} j-jaw f Rbat?","ar":"{كيفاش} الجو فالرباط؟","en":"How is the weather in Rabat?"},{"lat":"{kifach} t3arefti m3a Karim?","ar":"{كيفاش} تعرفتي مع كريم؟","en":"How did you get to know Karim?"},{"lat":"{kifach} kanektbu smitek?","ar":"{كيفاش} كنكتبو سميتك؟","en":"How do we write your name?"},{"lat":"{kifach} n9der n3awnek?","ar":"{كيفاش} نقدر نعاونك؟","en":"How can I help you?"},{"lat":"{kifach} ghadi nmchi l s-suq?","ar":"{كيفاش} غادي نمشي للسوق؟","en":"How am I going to get to the market?"}]},
{"id":"3lach","lat":"3lach","ar":"علاش","en":"why","note":"Often followed by ma plus a verb plus -ch: 3lach ma jitich? (why did you not come?).","s":[{"lat":"{3lach} ma jitich l-bare7?","ar":"{علاش} ما جيتيش البارح؟","en":"Why did you not come yesterday?"},{"lat":"{3lach} katbki?","ar":"{علاش} كتبكي؟","en":"Why are you crying?"},{"lat":"{3lach} ghadi tmchi daba?","ar":"{علاش} غادي تمشي دابا؟","en":"Why are you leaving now?"},{"lat":"{3lach} ma katjawebnich?","ar":"{علاش} ما كتجاوبنيش؟","en":"Why do you not answer me?"},{"lat":"{3lach} l-bab msdud?","ar":"{علاش} الباب مسدود؟","en":"Why is the door closed?"},{"lat":"{3lach} kaykhdem dima f l-lil?","ar":"{علاش} كيخدم ديما فالليل؟","en":"Why does he always work at night?"},{"lat":"{3lach} t3ettelti?","ar":"{علاش} تعطلتي؟","en":"Why are you late?"},{"lat":"{3lach} katd7ek?","ar":"{علاش} كتضحك؟","en":"Why are you laughing?"},{"lat":"{3lach} ma bghitich tji m3ana?","ar":"{علاش} ما بغيتيش تجي معانا؟","en":"Why did you not want to come with us?"},{"lat":"{3lach} l-7anut msdud daba?","ar":"{علاش} الحانوت مسدود دابا؟","en":"Why is the shop closed now?"}]},
{"id":"achnu","lat":"achnu","ar":"أشنو","en":"what","note":"Also chnu, the short form. Before a verb it asks what (achnu bghiti?); for what is this say achnu hadchi?","s":[{"lat":"{achnu} hadchi?","ar":"{أشنو} هادشي؟","en":"What is this?"},{"lat":"{achnu} bghiti tchrub?","ar":"{أشنو} بغيتي تشرب؟","en":"What do you want to drink?"},{"lat":"{achnu} katdir daba?","ar":"{أشنو} كتدير دابا؟","en":"What are you doing now?"},{"lat":"{achnu} kayn f had s-senduq?","ar":"{أشنو} كاين فهاد الصندوق؟","en":"What is in this box?"},{"lat":"{achnu} ghadi nakulu f l-3cha?","ar":"{أشنو} غادي نكلو فالعشا؟","en":"What are we going to eat for dinner?"},{"lat":"{achnu} 9ulti?","ar":"{أشنو} قلتي؟","en":"What did you say?"},{"lat":"{achnu} khessek?","ar":"{أشنو} خاصك؟","en":"What do you need?"},{"lat":"{achnu} smitek?","ar":"{أشنو} سميتك؟","en":"What is your name?"},{"lat":"{achnu} t3ellemti f l-mdrasa?","ar":"{أشنو} تعلمتي فالمدرسة؟","en":"What did you learn at school?"},{"lat":"{achnu} t7ebb tchri mn s-suq?","ar":"{أشنو} تحب تشري من السوق؟","en":"What would you like to buy from the market?"}]},
{"id":"chkun","lat":"chkun","ar":"شكون","en":"who","note":"Used for people only. For a thing say achnu.","s":[{"lat":"{chkun} had r-rajel?","ar":"{شكون} هاد الراجل؟","en":"Who is this man?"},{"lat":"{chkun} jab had l-hdiya?","ar":"{شكون} جاب هاد الهدية؟","en":"Who brought this gift?"},{"lat":"{chkun} f l-bab?","ar":"{شكون} فالباب؟","en":"Who is at the door?"},{"lat":"{chkun} kayskun f had d-dar?","ar":"{شكون} كيسكن فهاد الدار؟","en":"Who lives in this house?"},{"lat":"{chkun} 3ndu l-mfatih?","ar":"{شكون} عندو المفاتيح؟","en":"Who has the keys?"},{"lat":"{chkun} bgha ychrub atay?","ar":"{شكون} بغا يشرب أتاي؟","en":"Who wants to drink tea?"},{"lat":"{chkun} kayt3ellem d-darija m3ak?","ar":"{شكون} كيتعلم الدارجة معاك؟","en":"Who is learning Darija with you?"},{"lat":"{chkun} kteb had r-risala?","ar":"{شكون} كتب هاد الرسالة؟","en":"Who wrote this letter?"},{"lat":"{chkun} hiya had l-mra?","ar":"{شكون} هي هاد المرا؟","en":"Who is this woman?"},{"lat":"{chkun} ghadi ytiyyeb l-3cha?","ar":"{شكون} غادي يطيب العشا؟","en":"Who is going to cook dinner?"}]},
{"id":"chhal","lat":"chhal","ar":"شحال","en":"how much / how many","note":"Price, number, age, time and distance all use chhal: chhal mn (how many), chhal f s-sa3a (what time is it).","s":[{"lat":"{chhal} had l-qmija?","ar":"{شحال} هاد القميجة؟","en":"How much is this shirt?"},{"lat":"{chhal} 3ndk mn 3am?","ar":"{شحال} عندك من عام؟","en":"How old are you?"},{"lat":"{chhal} mn wa7ed kayn hna?","ar":"{شحال} من واحد كاين هنا؟","en":"How many people are here?"},{"lat":"{chhal} f s-sa3a?","ar":"{شحال} فالساعة؟","en":"What time is it?"},{"lat":"{chhal} katdir f ch-chher?","ar":"{شحال} كتدير فالشهر؟","en":"How much do you make a month?"},{"lat":"{chhal} bqa 3la l-3id?","ar":"{شحال} بقى على العيد؟","en":"How long is it until the Eid?"},{"lat":"{chhal} mn ktab 3ndk?","ar":"{شحال} من كتاب عندك؟","en":"How many books do you have?"},{"lat":"{chhal} kayb3d l-bank mn hna?","ar":"{شحال} كيبعد البنك من هنا؟","en":"How far is the bank from here?"},{"lat":"{chhal} ghadi ndfe3?","ar":"{شحال} غادي ندفع؟","en":"How much am I going to pay?"},{"lat":"{chhal} tsenneti?","ar":"{شحال} تسنيتي؟","en":"How long did you wait?"}]}]}
